cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use tSB-gamlss in your research, please cite this software.
  Cite the associated scientific publication separately when available.
type: software
title: "tSB-gamlss: t-Simplex-Binomial distribution and regression tools for R"
authors:
  - given-names: "Kevin Cristopher"
    family-names: "Gargate Osorio"
abstract: >-
  Research implementation of the t-Simplex-Binomial distribution and regression
  tools using Rcpp, Gauss-Legendre quadrature, and the GAMLSS framework,
  with distribution diagnostics, expected-information calculations,
  boundary evaluations, and reproducibility tests.
keywords:
  - "t-Simplex-Binomial"
  - "GAMLSS"
  - "Rcpp"
  - "bounded count data"
  - "research software"
license: MIT
